":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。法律写明「接种单位接种免疫规划疫苗不得收取任何费用」。要按月龄跑几趟接种门诊。预防接种证收好，别弄丢"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["孩子入托、入学的时候，托幼机构和学校要查验预防接种证。发现没按规定接种免疫规划疫苗的，要报告接种单位，并且配合督促监护人补种。所以漏打的疫苗拖不过去，入学时一定会被查出来。现在执行的是 2026 年版程序。人乳头瘤病毒（HPV）疫苗已经纳入国家免疫规划。百白破疫苗的起始接种年龄从 3 月龄改成 2…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：按国家免疫规划把该打的疫苗打齐，全程免费，错过了只补没打完的剂次"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。法律写明「接种单位接种免疫规划疫苗不得收取任何费用」。要按月龄跑几趟接种门诊。预防接种证收好，别弄丢"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["孩子入托、入学的时候，托幼机构和学校要查验预防接种证。发现没按规定接种免疫规划疫苗的，要报告接种单位，并且配合督促监护人补种。所以漏打的疫苗拖不过去，入学时一定会被查出来。现在执行的是 2026 年版程序。人乳头瘤病毒（HPV）疫苗已经纳入国家免疫规划。百白破疫苗的起始接种年龄从 3 月龄改成 2 月龄，一共 5 剂，分别在 2 月龄、4 月龄、6 月龄、18 月龄和 6 周岁各打 1 剂。西藏、青海、新疆和新疆生产建设兵团的适龄儿童，2026 年 3 月起也常规接种乙脑疫苗。几种疫苗可以同一天打：现阶段国家免疫规划疫苗都可以按免疫程序或补种原则同时接种。两种及以上打针的疫苗要打在不同部位，「严禁将两种或多种疫苗混合吸入同一支注射器内接种」。没在同一天打的，两种及以上打针的减毒活疫苗之间要间隔不小于 28 天。灭活疫苗、口服的减毒活疫苗和其他疫苗之间的间隔不作限制。不满 18 周岁的补种原则是尽早补种，「只需补种未完成的剂次，无需重新开始全程接种」，同一种疫苗换厂家可以接着打（全国，2026 年版程序）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2019). 疫苗管理法（第四十八、四十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://ynswsjkw.yn.gov.cn/html/2019/faguiguizhangxin_0731/6509.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://ynswsjkw.yn.gov.cn/html/2019/faguiguizhangxin_0731/6509.html"]},"（云南省卫生健康委员会转载）；国家疾病预防控制局、国家卫生健康委 (2026). 《国家免疫规划疫苗儿童免疫程序及说明（2026 年版）》解读问答. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ndcpa.gov.cn/jbkzzx/c100013/common/content/content_2073002930292035584.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ndcpa.gov.cn/jbkzzx/c100013/common/content/content_2073002930292035584.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["最常见的误会是「孩子体质不好，先别打」。官方说法是：所谓「过敏性体质」、家里人有过敏的病、孩子以前对食物或药物过敏过，都不是不能打的理由。特应性皮炎（湿疹）、荨麻疹、过敏性鼻炎、支气管哮喘，只要病情稳定就能正常打。正在吃抗过敏药，或者在用吸入型激素，也能打。新生儿的生理性黄疸、母乳性黄疸也能正常打。真正不能打的只有两种：以前打同一种疫苗出现过急性的严重过敏反应，或者对疫苗里已知的某种成分严重过敏。有免疫缺陷的孩子，以及正在化疗放疗、正在用免疫抑制剂的孩子，要一个个单独评估，去接种门诊说明情况再定。乙肝第一针见第 2 条。自费的非免疫规划疫苗要另收疫苗费和接种服务费，和这条说的免费无关。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/20-02"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"出生后 24 小时内打上乙肝疫苗第一针"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/20-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"前 6 个月只喂母乳，连水都不用喂，6 个月起加辅食并继续母乳"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-01"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["让婴儿期的孩子仰着睡，睡硬的平面，同房不同床，床上不放任何软东西"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子还是婴儿的时候，让他脸朝上躺着睡，睡在硬的平面上。大人和孩子睡同一间房，但不睡同一张床。床上不放枕头、被子、床围、毛绒玩具和定型枕。斜着的摇篮和婴儿椅只能坐…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["冲奶粉用 70 ℃ 以上的水，冲好放凉再喂，喝剩的倒掉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["奶粉不是无菌的，可能带一种细菌，新生儿感染后四成到八成会死。先倒热水，等降到约 73.8 ℃ 再放奶粉，能把这种菌杀到原来的十万分之一以下。热水会让维生素 C…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不满 1 岁不喂蜂蜜"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子不满 1 岁，不要喂蜂蜜。蜂蜜水、拌进辅食里的蜂蜜、含蜂蜜的糕点，都算。蜂蜜里可能带有引起肉毒中毒的细菌。大人肚子里的菌群能压住它，婴儿压不住。自家做的腌菜…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出生时的维生素 K 针一定要打"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["新生儿身体里存的维生素 K 很少，不补可能出血，晚出现的那种常常是脑子里出血。在没普遍打这一针的地方，每 10 万个新生儿有 478 个出这种血。打了这一针，估…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不满 3 个月的婴儿体温到 38 ℃ 就直接去医院，不在家观察"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子不满 3 个月，体温到 38 ℃ 就直接去医院。不要在家观察，也不要先喂退烧药再等等看。这个月龄的孩子就算得的是严重细菌感染，也可能只表现为发热。所以「看着…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["无论多累多气都不要摇晃婴儿"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["婴儿的头大，脖子没力气。用力摇晃会让他脑子里、眼睛里出血，可能要了他的命，也可能留下一辈子的残疾。哄睡时轻轻晃不算，危险的是控制不住的猛晃。快压不住火时，把孩子…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/20"},"children":["阅读整个主题：刚出生的孩子怎么带 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","pr